    title: "Sprint Board"
    description: "Agile sprint task board."
    shapeIndex: 2
    mamlText: "{\n  sprint: \"Sprint 1\"\n  tasks: [\n    {\n      id: \"UGGCUJ\"\n      title: \"connecting the bus won't do anything, we need to input the virtual SMTP application!\"\n      assignee: \"Granville Franecki\"\n      priority: \"medium\"\n      status: \"todo\"\n      points: 13\n    }\n\n    {\n      id: \"F2HC8K\"\n      title: \"If we connect the pixel, we can get to the CLI sensor through the digital SMTP sensor!\"\n      assignee: \"Liza Windler I\"\n      priority: \"low\"\n      status: \"done\"\n      points: 1\n    }\n\n    {\n      id: \"JDTZL5\"\n      title: \"We need to calculate the optical HEX bus!\"\n      assignee: \"Paxton Dietrich\"\n      priority: \"medium\"\n      status: \"in_progress\"\n      points: 5\n    }\n\n    {\n      id: \"IQZELQ\"\n      title: \"I'll copy the virtual VGA microchip, that should feed the XSS bandwidth!\"\n      assignee: \"Micheal Blanda MD\"\n      priority: \"medium\"\n      status: \"todo\"\n      points: 2\n    }\n\n    {\n      id: \"8TSB8M\"\n      title: \"If we copy the interface, we can get to the DNS pixel through the virtual CLI hard drive!\"\n      assignee: \"Amir Predovic\"\n      priority: \"medium\"\n      status: \"in_progress\"\n      points: 1\n    }\n\n    {\n      id: \"0HA4KC\"\n      title: \"Try to calculate the RAM pixel, maybe it will parse the primary alarm!\"\n      assignee: \"Janelle Collier\"\n      priority: \"critical\"\n      status: \"done\"\n      points: 1\n    }\n  ]\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "2461"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Ainu Canola Oil Soup\"\n  servings: 5\n  prep_time: \"41 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"56 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 pieces camomile\"\n    \"3 pieces oat flour\"\n    \"4 pieces tempeh\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Baked rice flour-stuffed kangaroo, seasoned with cayenne pepper and juicy herbs, accompanied by roasted cucumber medley.\"\n    \"Our sour duck, slow-cooked to perfection, accompanied by steamed rhubarb and a rich, savory gravy.\"\n    \"Three raspberry with iceberg lettuce, turnips, asparagus, green beans and arrowroot. With a side of baked juniper berry, and your choice of bonito flakes or corn oil.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of rich beans, complemented by lemon and sweet laurel.\"\n    \"Baked oyster mushrooms-stuffed lamb, seasoned with chives and zesty herbs, accompanied by roasted bean shoots medley.\"\n    \"A heartwarming Indonesian soup, featuring fresh clams and an aromatic blend of traditional spices.\"\n    \"Fresh sesame oil with a pinch of sweet laurel, topped by a caramelized goji berry with whipped cream\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 628\n    protein: \"5g\"\n    carbs: \"33g\"\n    fat: \"33g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "2462"
